Cleaned, encoded, and scaled DataFrame (`df_encoded`), ready for modeling.
Before/after visualizations for missing values and outliers.
A fitted `scikit-learn` `ColumnTransformer` producing a model-ready NumPy array (`X_processed`, shape 2000×46).
A written summary of all preprocessing decisions and their justification.
